# Publish the site after a change

When a requested change updates the live dashboard, commit it and push `main` in the same turn. Do not wait for a separate push request.

- The live site is https://yxwvwxy.github.io/sorting-database/ and deploys `docs/` on push to `main`.
- Keep `web/index.html` in sync with `docs/index.html`.
- Include the migration files for database changes that were already applied for that request.
- Do not commit secrets. Do not force-push.
